/P 85 0 R
/E (My research investigated the phytochemical composition and biological activities of Forsythiae fructus using four different solvent extracts. I independently cultured DLKP and DLKP-A lung cancer cell lines to evaluate anticancer activity and assessed antimicrobial effects against three bacterial and one fungal strain. Phytochemical profiling was performed using TLC, NMR, and PCA to explore the relationship between solvent polarity, chemical composition, and biological activity.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [16]
